(### Types of Backups) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 651.60 Tm
(1. **Full**: includes everything -- fast but uses more space.) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 619.60 Tm
(2. **Incremental**: only saves changes since the last backup. Fast) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 597.60 Tm
(for large files, high volume operations.) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 565.60 Tm
(3. **Differential**: saves differences from the most recent full) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 543.60 Tm
(backup. Good balance.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
0.500 0.500 0.550 rg
1 0 0 1 300.00 24.00 Tm
(3) Tj
ET
